# OpenVela NuttX ARM vendor build group.
#
# Each target appears twice: the plain entry schedules the build, the
# matching CMake, entry selects the CMake flow when testbuild.sh runs
# with -N. Blacklist entries use the testbuild grammar with the first
# slash of the target replaced by a colon, e.g.:
#   -Linux,vendor:openvela/boards/vela/configs/foo/

